{"segment_id": "segment_00003", "start": 90.0, "end": 120.0, "speech": "法，很简单。继续，I said，我之前就说，注意，你看后边就是一个一百三十五课咱们学过的语法，宾语从句。如果主句是一般过去时，从句时态要怎么样？情情态动词要怎么样？Will要变成would，can要变成could，may要变成might，对吧？这儿的will就变成would了。说I would be，我将at your house，将在你家，", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000010.webp", "time": 90.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "I said I would be at your house at six o'clock,", "but the boss want me to do some extra work.", "I'll have to stay at the office.I don't know", "when I'll finish. Oh, and by the way,", "my wife wants to know if Mary needs any help.", "JOHN SMITH: I don't know what you're talking about", "GRAHAM TURNER: That is John Smith, isn't it?"], "scores": [0.99875, 0.96678, 0.98692, 0.94892, 0.96698, 0.97961, 0.95883, 0.99326], "boxes": [[[1505.0, 46.0], [1777.0, 48.0], [1777.0, 94.0], [1505.0, 92.0]], [[55.0, 547.0], [1074.0, 549.0], [1074.0, 611.0], [55.0, 608.0]], [[60.0, 610.0], [1090.0, 614.0], [1090.0, 669.0], [60.0, 666.0]], [[55.0, 667.0], [1017.0, 672.0], [1017.0, 738.0], [55.0, 732.0]], [[57.0, 724.0], [904.0, 734.0], [903.0, 802.0], [56.0, 793.0]], [[57.0, 793.0], [1162.0, 793.0], [1162.0, 862.0], [57.0, 862.0]], [[58.0, 854.0], [1328.0, 854.0], [1328.0, 919.0], [58.0, 919.0]], [[63.0, 918.0], [1115.0, 918.0], [1115.0, 974.0], [63.0, 974.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000011.webp", "time": 106.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "I saidl would be at your house at six o'clock,", "but the boss want me to do some extra work.", "I'll have to stay at the office.I don't know", "when I'll finish. Oh, and by the way,", "my wife wants to know if Mary needs any help.", "JOHN SMITH: I don't know what you're talking about", "GRAHAM TURNER: That is John Smith, isn't it?"], "scores": [0.981, 0.97697, 0.96104, 0.95411, 0.96777, 0.98336, 0.9672, 0.99353], "boxes": [[[1501.0, 48.0], [1775.0, 48.0], [1775.0, 94.0], [1501.0, 94.0]], [[55.0, 545.0], [1069.0, 545.0], [1069.0, 610.0], [55.0, 610.0]], [[61.0, 610.0], [1093.0, 616.0], [1093.0, 671.0], [61.0, 666